The user sounds should work. Make sure that SOUNDDIR option in defaults.nh
is set to the full path of the folder with sound files since Pocket PC does
not have a concept of "current directory".
The other thing to check is that sounds are enabled under
device Settings->Sounds and Notifications. "Enable sounds" for "Programs"
has to be checked.



